913afdff-db0e-11ef-81de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"屬玉觀","place_name_jianti_auto":"属玉观","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"913afe00-db0e-11ef-80cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"913afe01-db0e-11ef-a11d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"應劭曰：萯陽宮在鄠，秦文王所起。伏儼曰：在扶風。李斐曰：萯，音倍。師古曰：應說、李音是也。服虔曰：屬玉觀，以玉飾，因名焉，在扶風。李奇曰：屬玉，音鷟鸑。其上有此鳥，因以爲名。晉灼曰：屬玉，水鳥，似鵁鶄，以名觀也。師古曰：晉說是也。屬，音之欲翻。觀，工玩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"应劭曰：萯阳宫在鄠，秦文王所起。伏俨曰：在扶风。李斐曰：萯，音倍。师古曰：应说、李音是也。服虔曰：属玉观，以玉饰，因名焉，在扶风。李奇曰：属玉，音𬸦𬸚。其上有此鸟，因以为名。晋灼曰：属玉，水鸟，似䴔䴖，以名观也。师古曰：晋说是也。属，音之欲翻。观，工玩翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"913afdf0-db0e-11ef-bb25-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"萯陽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"萯阳宫","resolved_place_entity_id":5233,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"913afe02-db0e-11ef-8bd3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"屬玉觀","place_name_jianti_auto":"属玉观","resolved_place_entity_id":6734,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"913afe03-db0e-11ef-bea4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"萯，读曰倍。又县北有宜春观，汉武帝建。《水经注》：涝水经...","context_before":"...县西南二十三里。秦惠文王时建。始皇九年，迁太后于萯阳宫。","source_end_index":49,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"27463671-cb89-5894-96fa-06a78b9e5275","source_start_index":32,"source_text":"汉甘露二年，幸萯阳宫属玉观，是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"6冬，十二月，上行幸萯陽宮、屬玉觀。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十二月，汉宣帝巡幸萯阳宫、属玉观。","content_jianti_auto":"6冬，十二月，上行幸萯阳宫、属玉观。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2164,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"913afdef-db0e-11ef-a248-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":8,"chapter_name":"评论篇第八","chenzhu_chapter":"注中有论，由来尚矣，毛公之训《诗》，安国之传《书》，郑君之释《礼》，王弼之解《易》，皆有时参以论议。马、班而降，史论尤繁，荀悦曰论，陈寿曰评，裴松之引孙盛、徐众之书，亦皆以评为号，则评论实注家之一体也。胡注《通鉴》，评论亦众，此篇之外，散见于《史事》各篇者，大抵皆评论也。自清代文字狱迭兴，学者避之，始群趋于考据，以空言为大戒。不知言为心声，觇古人者宜莫善于此，胡明仲之《管见》，王船山之《鉴论》，皆足代表一时言议，岂得概以空言视之，《通鉴注》中之评论，亦犹是也。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":4,"chenzhu_text":"卫青，汉武帝卫思后弟，霍去病则卫思后姊子也。王深宁曰：“外戚秉政，未或不亡。汉亡于王莽、何进，晋亡于贾谧，唐几亡于杨国忠，石晋亡于冯玉。”语见《困学纪闻》三。歇后一语，则宋亡于贾似道也。身之此条，以为赵充国之贤之功，犹只列之恩泽侯，而况不如赵充国，并不如卫青、霍去病者乎！盖亦有所指也。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":13,"tongjian_id":"CH08-CZ004"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"營平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"营平侯","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"913afe06-db0e-11ef-8128-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙充國","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵充国","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"913afe07-db0e-11ef-a0d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"913afe08-db0e-11ef-9512-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞青","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞青","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"913afe09-db0e-11ef-99d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"霍去病","people_name_jianti_auto":"霍去病","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"913afe0a-db0e-11ef-adf9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"913afe0b-db0e-11ef-8f7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞思后","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞思后","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"913afe0c-db0e-11ef-8166-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"913afe0d-db0e-11ef-afc5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濟南","place_name_jianti_auto":"济南","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"913afe0e-db0e-11ef-a88c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"913afe0f-db0e-11ef-a946-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"恩澤侯表：營平侯，食邑於濟南。夫以趙充國之賢之功，而班史列之恩澤侯者，以其初封以定策功也。如衞青、霍去病本以破匈奴功封，而班史亦列於恩澤侯，以其由衞思后戚屬得進也。班史書法，猶有古史官典刑，後之爲史者不復知此矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"恩泽侯表：营平侯，食邑于济南。夫以赵充国之贤之功，而班史列之恩泽侯者，以其初封以定策功也。如衞青、霍去病本以破匈奴功封，而班史亦列于恩泽侯，以其由衞思后戚属得进也。班史书法，犹有古史官典刑，后之为史者不复知此矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"913afe05-db0e-11ef-8122-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先，悉薦翻。弟，與第同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先，悉荐翻。弟，与第同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"913afe14-db0e-11ef-b115-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe16-db0e-11ef-819d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：與，讀曰豫。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：与，读曰豫。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"913afe15-db0e-11ef-ad80-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"營平壯武侯","official_note":"營平壯武侯是趙充國的封爵，表示其爵位和封地，在漢代屬於貴族封號，用於表彰功績。此處在原文中標示趙充國的身份，並提及他去世。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"營平壯武侯趙充國薨","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"5cba75ab-d5be-4e7d-8b4c-49697fb8bd90"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-137,"link_death_year":-52,"link_td_description":"赵充国，字翁孙，西汉时期的军事将领和官员。","link_td_id":"Q10006238","link_td_number_id":1280273,"people_name":"營平壯武侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"营平壮武侯","people_xingming":"赵充国","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"913afe17-db0e-11ef-8df3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-137,"link_death_year":-52,"link_td_description":"赵充国，字翁孙，西汉时期的军事将领和官员。","link_td_id":"Q10006238","link_td_number_id":1280273,"people_name":"趙充國","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵充国","people_xingming":"赵充国","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"913afe18-db0e-11ef-b43a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-137,"link_death_year":-52,"link_td_description":"赵充国，字翁孙，西汉时期的军事将领和官员。","link_td_id":"Q10006238","link_td_number_id":1280273,"people_name":"充國","people_name_jianti_auto":"充国","people_xingming":"赵充国","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"913afe19-db0e-11ef-83cb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《汉表》：邑在济。是也。或以菅城当之，谬矣。《志》云：菅...","context_before":"...入平陵。《通志》：故菅城在章丘临济镇北。《述征记》似误。","source_end_index":171,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a768576c-29bf-5a4b-811a-9db17a86e756","source_start_index":146,"source_text":"又营平城亦在县西。汉宣帝封赵充国为营平侯，邑于此。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"7是歲，營平壯武侯趙充國薨。先是，充國以老乞骸骨，賜安車、駟馬、黃金，罷就弟。朝廷每有四夷大議，常與參兵謀、問籌策焉。","content_fanyi":"这年，营平壮武侯赵充国去世。此前，赵充国因年老请求退休，汉宣帝赐给他安车、驷马、黄金，让他免职回到府第。每当朝廷有涉及四夷的重大朝议，常让他参与军事谋划，并向他询问计策。","content_jianti_auto":"7是岁，营平壮武侯赵充国薨。先是，充国以老乞骸骨，赐安车、驷马、黄金，罢就弟。朝廷每有四夷大议，常与参兵谋、问筹策焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2165,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"913afe04-db0e-11ef-91a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe1c-db0e-11ef-8f3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"913afe1d-db0e-11ef-81a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"913afe1e-db0e-11ef-8564-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"913afe1f-db0e-11ef-8f9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原郡","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"913afe20-db0e-11ef-a850-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"913afe21-db0e-11ef-aeb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"九原郡","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"913afe22-db0e-11ef-ada4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"稒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"稒阳","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"913afe23-db0e-11ef-a6dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五原縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原县","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"913afe24-db0e-11ef-aa77-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"913afe25-db0e-11ef-8826-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五原","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"913afe26-db0e-11ef-9159-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"勝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"胜州","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"913afe27-db0e-11ef-a664-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆林縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆林县","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"913afe28-db0e-11ef-867d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：款，叩也。按班志，漢五原郡卽秦九原郡，治稒陽；別有五原縣。宋白曰：漢五原故城，在今勝州榆林縣界。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：款，叩也。按班志，汉五原郡即秦九原郡，治稒阳；别有五原县。宋白曰：汉五原故城，在今胜州榆林县界。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"913afe1b-db0e-11ef-a907-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe2b-db0e-11ef-a0e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：欲於甘露三年正月行朝禮。朝，直遙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：欲于甘露三年正月行朝礼。朝，直遥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"913afe2a-db0e-11ef-83e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"成周","place_name_jianti_auto":"成周","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"913afe2d-db0e-11ef-ad0b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此議猶依傍成周盛時朝諸侯之制。先、後，皆去聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此议犹依傍成周盛时朝诸侯之制。先、后，皆去声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"913afe2c-db0e-11ef-8b48-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言班曆所不及也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言班历所不及也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"913afe2e-db0e-11ef-a00a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"望之","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe30-db0e-11ef-9597-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"913afe31-db0e-11ef-bd2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"望之此議，取春秋傳王者不治夷狄之意。馬絡曰羈，牛靷曰縻。言其在荒服，待之若馬牛然，取羈縻不絕而已。師古曰：易·謙卦之辭曰：謙，亨，天道下濟而光明，地道卑而上行。言謙之爲德，無所不通也。亨，火庚翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"望之此议，取春秋传王者不治夷狄之意。马络曰羁，牛靷曰縻。言其在荒服，待之若马牛然，取羁縻不绝而已。师古曰：易·谦卦之辞曰：谦，亨，天道下济而光明，地道卑而上行。言谦之为德，无所不通也。亨，火庚翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"913afe2f-db0e-11ef-a881-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe35-db0e-11ef-85c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"伏生","people_name_jianti_auto":"伏生","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"913afe36-db0e-11ef-b4cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：逸書也。余謂此語，或者伏生之書有之，今國語猶載此言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：逸书也。余谓此语，或者伏生之书有之，今国语犹载此言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":158,"tongjian_id":"913afe34-db0e-11ef-927d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"亡，古無字通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"亡，古无字通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":167,"tongjian_id":"913afe39-db0e-11ef-bca9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"913afe3b-db0e-11ef-9029-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，朝見也。享，供時享也。享，獻也。古者諸侯見於天子，必以所貢助祭於廟。孝經所謂「四海之內，各以其職來祭」者也。卒，讀曰猝；師古子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，朝见也。享，供时享也。享，献也。古者诸侯见于天子，必以所贡助祭于庙。孝经所谓「四海之内，各以其职来祭」者也。卒，读曰猝；师古子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":185,"tongjian_id":"913afe3a-db0e-11ef-bc43-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe3e-db0e-11ef-aa74-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：卒，終也。謂本以客禮待之；若後不來，非叛臣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：卒，终也。谓本以客礼待之；若后不来，非叛臣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":190,"tongjian_id":"913afe3d-db0e-11ef-95ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂朝明年正月朔也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓朝明年正月朔也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":220,"tongjian_id":"913afe3f-db0e-11ef-abe1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"丞相","official_note":"丞相是汉代最高行政长官，辅佐皇帝处理全国政务。此处丞相与御史共同商议匈奴单于朝见的礼仪规格，体现了中枢机构在制定外交政策中的作用。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"丞相、御史曰","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"66cd9652-fe86-4631-b462-0f1471ae60bc"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史","official_note":"御史是汉代监察官员，负责纠察百官。此处御史与丞相共同商议匈奴单于朝见的礼仪，可能涉及对外事务的监督或礼仪制度的执行。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"丞相、御史曰","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"45405f97-89d0-487e-bd0f-fa0f8fb5dde6"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太子太傅","official_note":"太子太傅是太子的老师，负责教导太子。此处萧望之作为太子太傅，对匈奴单于朝见的礼仪提出不同意见，体现了文教官员在政治决策中的参与。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"太子太傅蕭望之","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"3989a52c-3073-491f-acf7-c31fcf0c75b3"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-31,"link_td_description":"呼韩邪单于（？－前31年），名稽侯狦，是西汉后期匈奴单于之一，挛鞮氏，虚闾权渠单于的儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10000775","link_td_number_id":356590,"people_name":"呼韓邪單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼韩邪单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮稽侯狦","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"913afe41-db0e-11ef-b05a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮稽侯狦]"},{"people_name":"匈奴單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮稽侯狦","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"913afe44-db0e-11ef-8f42-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-46,"link_td_description":"萧望之，字长倩，东海郡兰陵县（今山东省临沂市兰陵县）人，西汉大臣、汉元帝帝师、儒家学者，历任大鸿胪、太傅等官。被后世谱牒家附会为萧何六世孙。","link_td_id":"Q10004019","link_td_number_id":1485174,"people_name":"蕭望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"萧望之","people_xingming":"萧望之","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"913afe48-db0e-11ef-bf5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"匈奴單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮稽侯狦","start_index":208,"tongjian_id":"913afe4b-db0e-11ef-a1c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"913afe42-db0e-11ef-908b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五原塞","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原塞","place_note":"內蒙包頭","resolved_place_entity_id":3070,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"913afe43-db0e-11ef-b8ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"913afe45-db0e-11ef-9534-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"諸夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"诸夏","resolved_place_entity_id":2058,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"913afe46-db0e-11ef-b966-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"諸夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"诸夏","resolved_place_entity_id":2058,"start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"913afe47-db0e-11ef-9e4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":169,"tongjian_id":"913afe4a-db0e-11ef-878e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《正义》：五原塞，即五原郡。榆林塞，在胜州榆林县西四十里...","context_before":"...朔方，匈奴绝翅伤翼。又枚乘曰：秦北备榆中之关。皆谓此也。","source_end_index":287,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"87fb7b37-661f-5d2f-b742-558b0b2c5a64","source_start_index":272,"source_text":"宣帝甘露二年，呼韩邪款五原塞。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交","内政"],"content":"8匈奴呼韓邪單于款五原塞，願奉國珍，朝三年正月。詔有司議其儀。丞相、御史曰：「聖王之制，先京師而後諸夏，先諸夏而後夷狄。匈奴單于朝賀，其禮儀宜如諸侯王，位次在下。」太子太傅蕭望之以爲：「單于非正朔所加，故稱敵國，宜待以不臣之禮，位在諸侯王上。外夷稽首稱藩，中國讓而不臣，此則羈縻之誼，謙亨之福也。書曰：『戎狄荒服』，言其來服荒忽亡常。如使匈奴後嗣卒有鳥竄鼠伏，闕於朝享，不爲畔臣，萬世之長策也。」天子采之，下詔曰：「匈奴單于稱北蕃，朝正朔。朕之不德，不能弘覆。其以客禮待之，令單于位在諸侯王上，贊謁稱臣而不名。」","content_fanyi":"匈奴呼韩邪单于抵达五原郡边塞，表示愿意奉献本国珍宝，在甘露三年正月到长安朝见汉宣帝。宣帝下诏命主管官员商议朝见礼仪。丞相、御史大夫说：“按照圣王的礼制，京师之礼先于诸侯国，诸侯国之礼先于四方夷狄。匈奴单于前来朝贺，礼仪应当如同诸侯王，位次排在诸侯王之后。”太子太傅萧望之认为：“单于并非接受汉朝正朔的臣属，所以称作与汉朝对等的国家，不应当用对待臣属的礼仪来接待他，位次应在诸侯王之上。外夷向我朝叩首称藩，中国却谦让而不以臣属相待，这正是加以笼络的合宜之道，也是谦逊带来的亨通福分。《尚书》说：‘戎狄荒服’，意思是他们前来归服时荒忽不定、没有常性。如果将来匈奴的后代突然像飞鸟远窜、老鼠潜伏一样，不再前来朝见进贡，也不算背叛我国的臣子，这才是万世的长远策略。”宣帝采纳了他的建议，下诏说：“匈奴单于自称是我国北方的藩属，将在明年正月初一前来朝见。朕的德行不够，不能广泛庇护。应当用宾客之礼接待他，让单于的位次排在诸侯王之上，谒见时只称臣而不称名。”","content_jianti_auto":"8匈奴呼韩邪单于款五原塞，愿奉国珍，朝三年正月。诏有司议其仪。丞相、御史曰：「圣王之制，先京师而后诸夏，先诸夏而后夷狄。匈奴单于朝贺，其礼仪宜如诸侯王，位次在下。」太子太傅萧望之以为：「单于非正朔所加，故称敌国，宜待以不臣之礼，位在诸侯王上。外夷稽首称藩，中国让而不臣，此则羁縻之谊，谦亨之福也。书曰：『戎狄荒服』，言其来服荒忽亡常。如使匈奴后嗣卒有鸟窜鼠伏，阙于朝享，不为畔臣，万世之长策也。」天子采之，下诏曰：「匈奴单于称北蕃，朝正朔。朕之不德，不能弘覆。其以客礼待之，令单于位在诸侯王上，赞谒称臣而不名。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"韩延寿良吏也，忌其名而讦其小过以陷之死。丙吉贤相也，则倨...","context_before":"...也。匈奴内溃，群臣议灭之，望之则曰：“不当乘乱而幸灾。”","source_end_index":153,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"39482594-52ec-4156-93a8-9b6464425ccb","source_start_index":118,"source_text":"呼韩邪入朝，丞相御史欲位之王侯之下，望之则曰：“待以不臣，谦亨之福。”"}],"title":"一八 萧望之难以大受"}],"id":2166,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"913afe1a-db0e-11ef-a7e6-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000594"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春秋之義，王者無外，故天王有入無出，大夫出不言奔，欲一乎天下也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋之义，王者无外，故天王有入无出，大夫出不言奔，欲一乎天下也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"913afe4d-db0e-11ef-b5a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"商頌·殷武之詩也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"商颂·殷武之诗也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"913afe4f-db0e-11ef-9c5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"祭公","people_name_jianti_auto":"祭公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"913afe52-db0e-11ef-b34b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"謀父","people_name_jianti_auto":"谋父","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"913afe53-db0e-11ef-9a99-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"國語：祭公謀父曰：「蠻夷要服，戎狄荒服。要服者貢，荒服者王。有不貢則脩名，有不王則脩德。於是讓不貢，告不王。於是有威讓之令，有文告之辭。」要，一遙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"国语：祭公谋父曰：「蛮夷要服，戎狄荒服。要服者贡，荒服者王。有不贡则修名，有不王则修德。于是让不贡，告不王。于是有威让之令，有文告之辞。」要，一遥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"913afe51-db0e-11ef-a318-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":148,"link_death_year":209,"link_td_description":"荀悦，字仲豫，颍川颍阳（今河南许昌）人，东汉末史学家，儒学思想家，政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10001291","link_td_number_id":105697,"people_name":"荀悅","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀悦","people_xingming":"荀悦","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"913afe55-db0e-11ef-8ab4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-46,"link_td_description":"萧望之，字长倩，东海郡兰陵县（今山东省临沂市兰陵县）人，西汉大臣、汉元帝帝师、儒家学者，历任大鸿胪、太傅等官。被后世谱牒家附会为萧何六世孙。","link_td_id":"Q10004019","link_td_number_id":1485174,"people_name":"望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"望之","people_xingming":"萧望之","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"913afe5b-db0e-11ef-97d1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"狄道","place_name_jianti_auto":"狄道","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"913afe57-db0e-11ef-975f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"氐","place_name_jianti_auto":"氐","resolved_place_entity_id":298,"start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"913afe58-db0e-11ef-a382-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","resolved_place_entity_id":140,"start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"913afe59-db0e-11ef-9c8c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"荀悅論曰：春秋之義，王者無外，欲一于天下也。戎狄道里遼遠，人迹介絕，故正朔不及，禮敎不加，非尊之也，其勢然也。詩云：「自彼氐、羌，莫敢不來王。」故要、荒之君必奉王貢；若不供職，則有辭讓號令加焉，非敵國之謂也。望之欲待以不臣之禮，加之王公之上，僭度失序，以亂天常，非禮也！若以權時之宜，則異論矣。","content_fanyi":"荀悦评论说：依照《春秋》的大义，天子统辖天下而不分内外，为的是使天下归于一体。戎狄外族由于道路遥远、人迹隔绝，所以中原的历法政令无法在那里颁行，礼仪教化也无法施加给他们；这并不是尊崇他们，而是形势使然。《诗经》说：“那些氐、羌部族，没有谁敢不来朝见天子。”所以，处于要服、荒服之地的远国君主也必须向天子进献贡品；如果不来履行贡职，就应先以文辞加以责问，继而用法令予以申斥，迫使他们前来朝见，而不能把他们称作对等的敌国。萧望之却想不用臣属之礼对待单于，让单于位居王公之上，这是僭越制度、丧失秩序、扰乱天常，不合于礼！如果只是一时权宜之计，那就另当别论了。","content_jianti_auto":"荀悦论曰：春秋之义，王者无外，欲一于天下也。戎狄道里辽远，人迹介绝，故正朔不及，礼教不加，非尊之也，其势然也。诗云：「自彼氐、羌，莫敢不来王。」故要、荒之君必奉王贡；若不供职，则有辞让号令加焉，非敌国之谓也。望之欲待以不臣之礼，加之王公之上，僭度失序，以乱天常，非礼也！若以权时之宜，则异论矣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2167,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"913afe4c-db0e-11ef-b55f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"913afe5e-db0e-11ef-880c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"五原","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"913afe5f-db0e-11ef-8912-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔方","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔方","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"913afe60-db0e-11ef-8d35-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"913afe61-db0e-11ef-bbd4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"913afe62-db0e-11ef-8e25-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北地","place_name_jianti_auto":"北地","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"913afe63-db0e-11ef-8e5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"913afe64-db0e-11ef-9172-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"913afe65-db0e-11ef-86fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按漢書「郡」下又有「郡」字。師古註曰：所過之郡，每爲發兵陳列於道，以爲寵衞也。七郡，謂過五原、朔方，西河、上郡、北地、馮翊而後至長安也。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按汉书「郡」下又有「郡」字。师古注曰：所过之郡，每为发兵陈列于道，以为宠衞也。七郡，谓过五原、朔方，西河、上郡、北地、冯翊而后至长安也。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"913afe5d-db0e-11ef-bc95-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"車騎都尉","official_note":"車騎都尉是汉代军事官职，负责车骑部队的指挥，此处韩昌担任此职，被派遣迎接单于，显示其军事和外交职能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"車騎都尉韓昌","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"1ee8e49c-0ea0-4152-a49e-88681d22e136"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韓昌","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩昌","people_xingming":"韩昌","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"913afe68-db0e-11ef-9201-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"9詔遣車騎都尉韓昌迎單于，發所過七郡二千騎爲陳道上。","content_fanyi":"汉宣帝下诏派遣车骑都尉韩昌前去迎接单于，征调沿途七郡的二千名骑兵在道路两旁列队表示隆重欢迎。","content_jianti_auto":"9诏遣车骑都尉韩昌迎单于，发所过七郡二千骑为陈道上。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2168,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"913afe5c-db0e-11ef-8fa7-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9138b428-db0e-11ef-97c7-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（己巳、前五二）","year_int":-52},"message":"succ